cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Chronoglobe Atlas
message: >-
  If you use the Chronoglobe Atlas, please cite it.
  Code in this repository is MIT. The dataset is CC-BY-4.0.
  Inherited shapes in borders/gpl/ are GPL-3.0.
  Each release is archived on Zenodo. Until a DOI is listed in this file,
  cite the versioned fact URL and this repository.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Dadashpour
    given-names: Sajjad
abstract: >-
  Sourced, citable data for chronoglobe.si: polities, rulers, capitals,
  borders, and layers (population, GDP, climate, governance) through time.
  Every fact has a permanent id, date bounds, a confidence label, and sources.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sajjaddadashpour/chronoglobe-atlas"
url: "https://chronoglobe.si"
